60	/**
61	 * User `where` fragment for accounts that COUNT toward the business numbers.
62	 * Excludes accounts flagged `excludeFromRevenue` (the owner's own/test/staff
63	 * accounts) so internal usage never inflates Revenue/MRR. Spread as `user: …`
64	 * into any revenue/MRR query that joins a User (wallet rows, servers, invoices).
65	 */
