81	 * "Credits issued" figure on /admin/billing. There are two admin credit tools and
82	 * the card only ever matched one of them: `adminCreditUser` writes "Admin credit
83	 * adjustment", `adjustBalance` (the control rendered on that very page, and on
84	 * every invoice) writes "Admin balance adjustment". Goodwill issued through the
